        "type": "thinking",
        "thinking": "I'm checking whether दम् (उपशमे, दिवादि, परस्मैपद) falls under पुषादि for luṅ formation, since पुषादिद्युताद्यॢदितः applies to roots in that specific subgroup starting from पुष, and दम् itself is उदित् rather than ऌदित्, so I need to verify its exact placement within the गण.\n\nTracing through the दिवादि list, शमु-दमु-तमु-श्रमु-भ्रमु-क्षमु-क्लमु-मदी form a cluster (शमादि) that comes well after पुष, meaning they're included within the पुषादि range which runs from पुष to the end of the गण. This confirms अङ् applies for the luṅ of दम्, giving forms like अदमत्, अदमताम्, अदमन् — matching the Siddhanta Kaumudi's treatment of शमु as अशमत्.\n\n",
        "signature": ""
